                                    <title ref="LIT6214MGSocrates"/>
                                    <incipit xml:lang="gez">ተአምሪሁ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis"/><cb n="22rb"/><gap reason="ellipsis"/> ወሀሎ፡ ፩ ብእሲ፡
                                        በኢየሩሳሌም፡ ዘስሙ፡ <sic>አቅዩጥስ፡</sic> ወይደዊ<supplied reason="omitted" resp="PRS8999Strelcyn">፡</supplied> 
                                        በሕማመ፡ ሥላቅ። ወቦ፡ ወልድ<supplied reason="omitted" resp="PRS8999Strelcyn">፡</supplied> ዘቦ፡ ጋኔን፡ ወባዕል፡ ውእቱ፡ 
